From: meta-calculinux <noreply@calculinux.org>
Subject: [PATCH] Fix RAUC overlay reconcile for wrynose-class upgrades

Plan before pruning writable status, fail-soft overlay upgrades, IntEnum
compat levels, post-reboot .dpkg-new from the new lower layer, and only
start cup-postreboot when pending-* files exist.

Signed-off-by: meta-calculinux <noreply@calculinux.org>

